Traffic_DL_SA_FDD_CA_Capable
    [Documentation]    * Start DL traffic for this TC
    ...                * Max throughput per TrfId is managed
    ...                * Traffic is done according above param.TrafficDuration
    ...                * Traffic check is done for each UE usind DOD (definition of done) with error deviation in percent

    ${ueid}          Set Variable     ${param.ue}
    ${trf_id}        Set Variable     ${param.trf_id}
    ${TptDL}         Set Variable     ${param.throughput}
    ${MaxTptTrf}     Set Variable     ${param.maxThroughputPerTransfer}
	${trfDur}        Set Variable     ${param.trfDuration}
	${dev}           Set Variable     ${param.deviation}

	Traffic.Traffic UE DL    ueSetting=${param}    throughput=${TptDL}
	...                      maxThroughputPerTransfer=${MaxTptTrf}    duration=${trfDur}    deviation=${dev}


Traffic_DL_UL_NSA_FDD_CA_Capable
    [Documentation]    * Start UL / DL traffic for this TC
    ...                * Traffic is done according above param.TrafficDuration
    ...                * Traffic check is done for each UE usind DOD (definition of done) with error deviation in percent

    ${ueid}          Set Variable     ${param.ue}
    ${trf_id}        Set Variable     ${param.trf_id}
    ${TptDL}         Set Variable     ${param.throughput}
	${TptUL}         Set Variable     ${param.throughputul}
    ${MaxTptTrf}     Set Variable     ${param.maxThroughputPerTransfer}
	${trfDur}        Set Variable     ${param.trfDuration}
	${dev}           Set Variable     ${param.deviation}

    Traffic UE UL DL         ueSetting=${param}    ulThroughput=${TptUL}    dlThroughput=${TptDL}
	...		                 maxThroughputPerTransfer=${MaxTptTrf}    duration=${trfDur}    deviation=${dev}

Collect EGATE console Logs
    [Documentation]    This keyword is used to collect egate_console.log from the /opt/wts/latest/ folder
    ...                This is collected in the Test Log Folder
    # Connect to WTS  alias=alias_wts
    ${alias_wts}                    SSH Wait For Connect                ${HOST_EPCSIM}

    Dated Log      Collecting ${tl.core.dir_path}/egate_console.log...
    csn.download_file               remote_path=${tl.core.dir_path}/egate_console.log
    ...                             local_path=${LOG_PATH}/egate_console.log
    ...                             connection=${alias_wts}
    Dated Log                  egate_console.log file stored to ${LOG_PATH}


WTS Setup DSS
    [Documentation]                 From sweng WTS Setup  !! maj 12/09/2023
    ...                             Aim of this KW is to pioritize SIB processing for DSS cells vs non DSS one, when a testline is configured
    ...                             with cells DSS and non DSS mode.
    ...                             Cells with dss mode need dss cell_setup egate commands.
    # ...                             Clean WTSEmu (processes, logs), restart ePC simulator (ePCSim)
    # ...                             and configure it to establish a X2 link between eNB and gNB if gNB is configured in NSA mode.
    # ...                             Wait for SIB-NR if not NSA and check cell setup.
    # ...
    # ...                             *Argument details:*
    # ...                             - *telnet_egate_addr*: eGate VM IP address (default: dynamically retrieved)
    # ...                             - *nbUe*: nb total of UE(s) to set in basic-setup LUA file (default value = 1)
    # ...                             - *nbSaUe*: nb of SA UE(s) to set in basic-setup LUA file (default value = 0)
    # ...                             - *shouldUseLua*: flag to choose between cfg or LUA basic-setup file (default value = True)
    # ...                             - *nbCell*: number of cell to check for SystemInformationBlock-NR (default value = 0)
    # ...                                         If nbCell=0 then checks are done for the total number of cells defined on the testline
    # ...                             - *list_of_UE_tobe_created*: list of UEs structure to be created when using lua (default value = None)
    # ...                                 mandatory params: ue & target_cells &{my_UE_SA}     ue=1    target_cells=2
    # ...                             - *time_to_wait*: time to wait the SIB (default value = 5min)
    # ...
    # ...                             Exemple:
    # ...                             | If nbUe = 10 and nbSaUe = 0, \ \ \ \ \ 10 NSA UE from 1 to 10, 0 SA UE
    # ...                             | If nbUe = 10 and nbSaUe = 5, \ \ \ \ \ \ 5 NSA UE from 1 to 5, 5 SA UE from 6 to 10
    # ...                             | If nbUe = 10 and nbSaUe = 10, \ \ \ \ \ 0 NSA UE, 10 SA UE from 1 to 10
    [Arguments]                     ${telnet_egate_addr}=${tl.core.default_ssh_connection_details.addr}
    ...                             ${nbUe}=1
    ...                             ${nbSaUe}=0
    ...                             ${shouldUseLua}=${True}
    ...                             ${bypassSIB}=${False}
    ...                             ${nbCell}=0
    ...                             ${list_of_UE_tobe_created}=${None}
    ...                             ${time_to_wait}=5min
    ...                             ${postprocessing}=CheckDSSCellSyncFail

    # there is no "['cells']['nr']" info in AIC data --> need to use of NRCELL_ID_LIST instead

    IF     ${isAic}
                            ${cell_len_1}        Get Number Of Not None Element in List   ${NRCELL_ID_LIST}
                            ${cell_len}    Set Variable    ${cell_len_1}
    ELSE
                            ${cell_len_2}        Get length           ${GNB_BTS_INFO['cells']['nr']}
                            ${cell_len}    Set Variable    ${cell_len_2}
    END

    ${cell_len}        Convert to string    ${cell_len}

    ${cell_nr}         set variable if      ${nbCell}==0    ${cell_len}    ${nbCell}

    set suite variable     ${cell_nr}
    # Clean WTS from process and logs point of view
    ${isSANSA}                   set variable if    '${NWtype}' == 'SA+NSA'    ${True}    ${False}
    set suite variable    ${isSANSA}
    ${isNSA}                     set variable if    '${NWtype}' == 'NSA'       ${True}    ${False}
    set suite variable    ${isNSA}
    ${alias}		                SSH Wait For Connect                    host=${HOST_EPCSIM}
    Dated Log New Line              Starting WTS setup ** WTS Setup for DSS Plus nonDSS cells mod ** (WTS:IP=${HOST_EPCSIM.sshConnection.addr})
    WTS Clear
    # Cloud only
    Run Keyword If                  ${TLConfig.isGnbCloud} and not ${isAic}
    ...                             WTS Set Backhaul IP                     ${alias}
    # If lua file is requested, then init lua config file with nb of UEs:
    ${LuaFileName}                  Run Keyword If      ${shouldUseLua}
    ...                                                 TxtConfig Init      nbUe=${nbUe}
    ...                                                                     nbSaUe=${nbSaUe}
    ...                                                                     list_of_UE_tobe_created=${list_of_UE_tobe_created}
    ...                                         ELSE    set variable        ${EMPTY}
    Dated Log                       LuaFileName=${LuaFileName}

    IF    not ${shouldUseLua}
                            Check For SaNsa
    END
    # Configure eDaemon and eGate
    WTS Start processes             telnet_egate_addr=${telnet_egate_addr}
    # Launching configuration
    WTS Configure upon format       shouldUseLua=${shouldUseLua}            luaFile=${LuaFileName}
    Dated Log                       Delay for SIBs is set to ${time_to_wait}
    run keyword if                  not ${isNSA} and not ${bypassSIB}       wait until keyword succeeds     ${time_to_wait}    1min
    ...                             ${postprocessing}


CheckDSSCellSyncFail
    [Documentation]                 Help to synchronise DSS cell_setup time to be start
    ...                             as DSS cells need egate command for cell_setup, this KW wait information
    ...                             from AP/WTS complaining waiting dss egate cell_setup commands.
    ...                             WARNING: on this KW no X2link set up is done, no UE_cell setup is done (need to be done after)

    CallSetup.Flush Egate Console Buffer
    Traced sleep   3s  msg=wait 3s to flush egate memory on egate_console.log
    ${sync_fail}                   SSH Wait For Connect and Cmd
    ...                            command=grep 'CellSyncProcedure failed after' ${tl.core.dir_path}/egate_console.log|sort -u|wc -l
    ...                            host=${HOST_EPCSIM}

    ${SyncFailArrived}  Set Variable If  ${sync_fail.strip()} >= 0    ${True}    ${False}

    [RETURN]  ${SyncFailArrived}


Setup_DSS_Cell
	CallSetup.WTS Set XpAP and X2 Link
    CallSetup.DSS Partnership Creation
    CallSetup.DSS Establish Partnership


Check_Cell_Setup_Ok
    [Documentation]    Check if all cells are up

    Dated Log           CheckSIB
    Check SIB Using Cell Number   nbCell=2

    Traced sleep   20s        msg=To let time to Airphone to perform is cells setup  #in order to let time for cell_setup on AP

    Dated Log           Check_AirPhone_APL3
    ${output}           SSH Wait For Connect and Cmd
	...                 command=grep -i completed /tmp/startup_l3.log
	#...                 host=${AIRSCALE_AP.sys[0].M}
    ...                 host=${AP_DU.sys[0].M}
    FOR    ${i}    IN RANGE    1  3
        Should Contain	    ${output}	 Cell Setup completed for [CELL_ID:${i}]
    END
